  "description": "A C# lock replacement for async/await, supporting recursion/re-entrance and asynchronous waits. Handles async recursion correctly - note that Nito.AsyncEx does not! Also provides an asnyc fiendly global Mutex class AsyncMutexLock.",
  "id": "EstrellasDeEsperanza.AsyncLock",
